Description: ShellOS kernel and memory tuning
 sysctl, I/O scheduler and THP/MGLRU defaults for ShellOS, zram swap with
 lz4 + zstd idle recompression, and shellos-senpai, a PSI-driven proactive
 reclaimer modelled on Meta's TMO.
